  "prefLabel": "Env-A 4801.01 Purpose",
  "priorExpiration": "2009-03-30",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 4801.01 Purpose. The purpose of this chapter is to provide for the administration and implementation of carbon dioxide (CO2) allowance auctions under RSA 125-O:20-29 and Env-A 4600, Carbon Dioxide (CO2) Budget Trading Program.\n\nSource. #9284, INTERIM, eff 10-1-08, EXPIRED: 3-30-09\n\nNew. #9445, eff 4-3-09; ss by #10470, eff 1-1-14; ss by #13974, eff 5-23-24",
